    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/d4e23573e078dec5b108f218103b0dd5.avif?t=1751971868\" width=388 height=71 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/880ae488854852b93edf5a2da61b8df1.poster.avif?t=1751971868\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/880ae488854852b93edf5a2da61b8df1.webm?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/880ae488854852b93edf5a2da61b8df1.mp4?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rhythm of Resistance is the world\u2019s first rhythm metroidvania \u2014 where music drives combat, movement, and exploration. In a future where culture is outlawed, Aria discovers an ancient music player that grants her extraordinary powers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/3a2396df6b7f89667427f7b228ea8f69.avif?t=1751971868\" width=383 height=71 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/ec2e3ed298c49cdb85d98d78cb7e785d.poster.avif?t=1751971868\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/ec2e3ed298c49cdb85d98d78cb7e785d.webm?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/ec2e3ed298c49cdb85d98d78cb7e785d.mp4?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover and play songs that change everything \u2014 shift enemy behavior, reveal hidden paths, and solve music-based puzzles as you expand your playlist.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/3b1b224199405249666de4ce1e661830.avif?t=1751971868\" width=417 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/8180ceaa5bfc61ee189d16b588d87b85.poster.avif?t=1751971868\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/8180ceaa5bfc61ee189d16b588d87b85.webm?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/8180ceaa5bfc61ee189d16b588d87b85.mp4?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Master rhythmic combat where timing is everything. Attack, parry, dodge, and unleash abilities in perfect sync with your soundtrack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/ba49a16835c183556824fcf4c0328da5.avif?t=1751971868\" width=375 height=71 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/6a081aa7dfbdb398cd7af8cf2a9de5ac.avif?t=1751971868\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>Journey through a vast, interconnected world of cathedrals, catacombs, and crumbling factories. Uncover the truth buried beneath silence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/3f60d53dbbf7c1ef515ce7c69a22c5e8.avif?t=1751971868\" width=504 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/14046a7bf6f5ad88ce33adb5c87ed596.poster.avif?t=1751971868\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/14046a7bf6f5ad88ce33adb5c87ed596.webm?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/14046a7bf6f5ad88ce33adb5c87ed596.mp4?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Upgrade the music player to unlock new abilities and amplify Aria\u2019s power.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/8947df3c519da6d110517505f2f6861f.avif?t=1751971868\" width=331 height=71 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/01d31d4741bebf47747f46eb6c9dac06.poster.avif?t=1751971868\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/01d31d4741bebf47747f46eb6c9dac06.webm?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269550/extras/01d31d4741bebf47747f46eb6c9dac06.mp4?t=1751971868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Break the silence. Discover the truth. Join the resistance and bring music back to the world.",
